en:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md05/025ga0070a07'>
//「西暦２００３年に解明されたばかりの問題
//を何故か１９４０年相当の世界で解かされて
//いる、この理不尽にもう流す涙もない皆様方。
//　微力ながらあてがお手伝いいたしましょう」
"Anyway, you're probably like, 'Wait. Doesn't this story take place in the Forties? Why do I have to tackle a math problem that won't actually be solved until 2003?'
  Well... you've got a point. But hey! That's why I'm here! To lend a helping hand."

